{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08750","headline":"对酒 · 李白","name":"对酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劝君莫拒杯，春风笑人来。\n桃李如旧识，倾花向我开。\n流莺啼碧树，明月窥金罍。\n昨日朱颜子，今日白发催。\n棘生石虎殿，鹿走姑苏台。\n自古帝王宅，城阙闭黄埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}